WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.112
watched the dragon's cube float to the middle of the stadium.

2
00:00:16.132 --> 00:00:22.395
"This fighter came to us by accident," the Battle Master said.

3
00:00:22.415 --> 00:00:25.737
"We don't know its name or where it's from.

4
00:00:26.397 --> 00:00:30.920
But its claws are sharp, and its breath—" Roar!

5
00:00:31.552 --> 00:00:33.393
The dragon shot flames into the air.

6
00:00:34.793 --> 00:00:35.673
The crowd screamed.

7
00:00:36.714 --> 00:00:37.994
Nebulon dropped his shield.

8
00:00:39.395 --> 00:00:40.475
He quickly picked it up.

9
00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:43.996
"I'm a g-great warrior!"

10
00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:44.956
he said.

11
00:00:44.976 --> 00:00:48.297
"I'm not afraid of—" Fwoosh!

12
00:00:48.737 --> 00:00:49.878
Flames shot toward him.

13
00:00:49.898 --> 00:00:52.739
"Ahh!" Nebulon ran.

14
00:00:53.559 --> 00:00:56.680
Roxy watched the dragon chase Nebulon all over the stadium.

15
00:01:00.588 --> 00:01:01.529
Wukong laughed.

16
00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.731
"Why is that guy so afraid?

17
00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:07.653
It's just a fire-breathing dragon."

18
00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:10.315
"That dragon is really powerful."

19
00:01:11.116 --> 00:01:12.997
Cozlin told him what happened on Delkor.

20
00:01:13.017 --> 00:01:17.040
"That sounds pretty bad," Wukong said.

21
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.381
"So the dragon's from Delkor?"

22
00:01:19.401 --> 00:01:21.883
"Nope." Roxy frowned.

23
00:01:21.903 --> 00:01:25.145
"Kid Comet left out a big part of the story."

24
00:01:25.946 --> 00:01:28.488
She told Wukong about the door in the mountain and the gold.

25
00:01:29.344 --> 00:01:30.465
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

26
00:01:30.485 --> 00:01:34.286
"You make it sound like this is all my fault!"

27
00:01:35.046 --> 00:01:35.867
Roxy groaned.

28
00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:38.688
"It is all your fault!"

29
00:01:39.588 --> 00:01:40.909
Nebulon tripped and fell.

30
00:01:41.409 --> 00:01:44.310
The dragon blasted fire as the warrior hid under his shield.

31
00:01:45.351 --> 00:01:46.351
Cozlin shook her head.

32
00:01:46.371 --> 00:01:51.133
"Nebulon should probably surrender."

33
00:01:51.153 --> 00:01:53.954
"Yep," Wukong said.

34
00:01:53.974 --> 00:01:56.735
"And we should probably talk to that dragon."

35
00:01:57.435 --> 00:01:58.616
Cozlin raised an eyebrow.

36
00:01:59.232 --> 00:02:00.092
"Talk to it?"

37
00:02:01.093 --> 00:02:02.033
Wukong shrugged.

38
00:02:02.053 --> 00:02:03.113
"Why not?

39
00:02:03.513 --> 00:02:04.474
Maybe it can help us."

40
00:02:04.494 --> 00:02:06.634
"I surrender!"

41
00:02:07.034 --> 00:02:07.935
Nebulon shouted.

42
00:02:08.775 --> 00:02:11.756
Roxy listened as the Battle Master announced the next battle.

43
00:02:12.616 --> 00:02:13.776
She heard the name Surina.

44
00:02:14.396 --> 00:02:17.517
But after that she stopped listening because her cube was moving.

45
00:02:18.278 --> 00:02:19.078
Roxy gulped.

46
00:02:19.098 --> 00:02:21.979
"It's my turn to battle!"

47
00:02:22.699 --> 00:02:23.699
Her friends cheered.

48
00:02:23.719 --> 00:02:26.380
"Go, Rocket Girl!"

49
00:02:27.016 --> 00:02:29.638
All around her, aliens in the crowd clapped and shouted.

50
00:02:30.778 --> 00:02:32.899
A moment later her cube was gone.

51
00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.381
She was on the stadium's floor, facing a robed figure.

52
00:02:36.401 --> 00:02:39.603
"That must be Surina," Roxy thought.

53
00:02:40.183 --> 00:02:42.945
"Hopefully this battle isn't too Whoa!

54
00:02:43.485 --> 00:02:44.326
What just happened?"

55
00:02:45.126 --> 00:02:46.467
The stadium seemed to be gone.

56
00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:50.589
Roxy now saw a strange forest, filled with alien trees.

57
00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:52.670
She looked back at Surina.

58
00:02:53.491 --> 00:02:55.052
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

59
00:02:55.784 --> 00:02:58.425
"Surina has the power to create illusions.

60
00:02:59.065 --> 00:03:01.026
Well, I have powers too!"

61
00:03:02.007 --> 00:03:04.548
Zoom! Roxy flew toward Surina.

62
00:03:05.008 --> 00:03:07.569
But before she reached her, Surina vanished.

63
00:03:08.149 --> 00:03:09.229
Roxy spun around.

64
00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.051
Now the fighter was on the other side of the forest.

65
00:03:12.771 --> 00:03:14.171
Roxy flew toward her again.

66
00:03:14.712 --> 00:03:19.754
Zoom! Suddenly a giant creature burst out of the ground!

67
00:03:19.774 --> 00:03:24.496
"Whoa!" Roxy turned fast and flew straight into Surina's fist.

68
00:03:24.876 --> 00:03:27.489
Pow! Roxy tumbled backward.

69
00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.511
She sat up.

70
00:03:30.612 --> 00:03:31.593
The creature was gone.

71
00:03:31.613 --> 00:03:35.956
"It wasn't real," Roxy thought.

72
00:03:36.517 --> 00:03:39.159
Then she spotted Surina peeking out from behind a tree.

73
00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.342
Roxy jumped up and fired her eye laser beams.

74
00:03:42.762 --> 00:03:47.045
Whiz-hoo! Surina vanished and reappeared in a different spot.

75
00:03:48.807 --> 00:03:49.828
Roxy fired again.

76
00:03:50.388 --> 00:03:53.050
Whiz-hoo! But again she missed.

77
00:03:55.172 --> 00:03:56.892
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired again and again.

78
00:03:57.733 --> 00:03:58.893
Surina grabbed her arm.

79
00:03:59.513 --> 00:04:02.594
Zoom! She dragged Roxy high into the air.

80
00:04:03.654 --> 00:04:04.955
Roxy blew her freeze breath.

81
00:04:05.435 --> 00:04:09.596
Whoosh! Surina's eyes went wide as ice formed around her.

82
00:04:10.356 --> 00:04:11.296
Her teeth chattered.

83
00:04:12.037 --> 00:04:14.597
"I s-surrender!"

84
00:04:16.318 --> 00:04:17.638
The forest disappeared.

85
00:04:18.778 --> 00:04:19.619
The audience cheered.

86
00:04:19.639 --> 00:04:21.319
"Rocket Girl!

87
00:04:21.879 --> 00:04:23.860
Rocket Girl!"

88
00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.464
Back in her cube, Roxy paced back and forth as the crowd cheered.

89
00:04:27.484 --> 00:04:30.608
"Who cares about a stupid fight?"

90
00:04:30.989 --> 00:04:31.490
she thought.

91
00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.412
"I need to—" Zoop!

92
00:04:34.233 --> 00:04:35.575
Her cube started to drop!
